Epoch_allowlist
├── given enforcement is enabled with seeded depositors
│   ├── when a seeded depositor supplies capital
│   │   └── it should settle the epoch and allow the depositor to claim shares
│   ├── when a seeded sponsor deposits for a seeded beneficiary
│   │   └── it should settle the epoch and mint shares only to the beneficiary
│   ├── when the depositor or sponsor is not allowlisted
│   │   └── it should revert without transferring assets or changing accounting
│   └── when the beneficiary is not allowlisted
│       └── it should revert without transferring assets or changing accounting
└── given a deposit was accepted before membership removal
    ├── when the depositor is removed
    │   └── it should block new deposits while allowing cancellation and refund
    ├── when the beneficiary is removed
    │   └── it should block new sponsored deposits while refunding the beneficiary on cancellation
    └── when both the sponsor and beneficiary are removed
        └── it should allow the beneficiary to claim shares, withdraw, and claim assets
